{"unit_id":"Zenjibad__deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin#feature-1","repo":"Zenjibad/deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin","commit":"3f2d36faed5fb6c63c8585b01afc8a56bbd39ca7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin 的功能「会话费用统计」：采集模型流返回的 token 用量，按模型价格累计当前会话费用。模型调用完成后自动更新统计，无需手动输入用量。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:547-557","src/index.ts:109-125"]}
{"unit_id":"Zenjibad__deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin#feature-2","repo":"Zenjibad/deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin","commit":"3f2d36faed5fb6c63c8585b01afc8a56bbd39ca7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin 的功能「账户余额」：读取 DSH 中的 DeepSeek API 密钥并查询账户余额，状态行展示余额及币种。插件定时刷新，密钥不可用或请求失败时显示余额不可用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:407-427","src/index.ts:431-465"]}
{"unit_id":"Zenjibad__deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin#feature-3","repo":"Zenjibad/deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin","commit":"3f2d36faed5fb6c63c8585b01afc8a56bbd39ca7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin 的功能「峰谷与烧钱速率」：按北京时间峰谷时段显示折扣状态，并用会话累计成本和开始时间估算每分钟费用。用户可同时观察当前价格时段与消费速度。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:73-93","src/index.ts:514-517"]}
{"unit_id":"Zenjibad__deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin#feature-4","repo":"Zenjibad/deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin","commit":"3f2d36faed5fb6c63c8585b01afc8a56bbd39ca7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin 的功能「账户币种换算」：使用实时汇率或配置的备用汇率，将人民币费用换成余额接口返回的币种；没有可用汇率时保留人民币金额。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:230-245","src/index.ts:496-512"]}
{"unit_id":"Zenjibad__deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin#caveat-1","repo":"Zenjibad/deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin","commit":"3f2d36faed5fb6c63c8585b01afc8a56bbd39ca7","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-cost-usage-status-plugin 使用前须知：余额查询会把 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY 作为 curl.exe 的 Authorization 参数传给子进程，因此同机其他进程可能看到该命令行参数。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:176-188","src/index.ts:440-447"]}
